# Anything excluded here is invisible to `docker build .` regardless of where
# the Dockerfile lives. Keeps build context small and prevents host-only state
# leaking into the image layer.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.nx
**/coverage
**/.turbo
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
e2e
test-results
playwright-report
*.log
*.tar
*.tar.gz
.DS_Store
